{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49724","headline":"虞美人 一 · 孙光宪","name":"虞美人 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"红窗寂寂无人语，暗淡棃花雨。\n绣罗纹地粉新描，博山香炷旋抽条，睡魂销。\n天涯一去无消息，终日长相忆。\n教人相忆几时休，不堪枨触别离愁，泪还流。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孙光宪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49724.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49724","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}